WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.208
"Try to catch me!" Sara said.

2
00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:20.873
The buddies were playing tag.

3
00:00:20.874 --> 00:00:24.210
"Here I come!" Rex said.

4
00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:26.572
He stomped toward Sara.

5
00:00:26.573 --> 00:00:29.511
Sara ran fast.

6
00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:30.781
"Oof!"

7
00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:35.484
She tripped over a dead branch.

8
00:00:35.485 --> 00:00:38.899
"Are you okay?" Tor asked.

9
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.539
Sara got up.

10
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:50.948
"I'm fine!" she said.

11
00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:53.645
Rex tagged Sara.

12
00:00:53.646 --> 00:00:56.698
"You're it!" he said.

13
00:00:56.699 --> 00:01:01.386
"Hmph!" Sara said.

14
00:01:01.387 --> 00:01:06.459
Sara saw Sid nearby.

15
00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.187
She ran toward him.

16
00:01:09.195 --> 00:01:11.286
Sid spun around.

17
00:01:11.287 --> 00:01:14.945
Sid stepped on thorns.

18
00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:19.094
"Ouch!" Sid cried.

19
00:01:19.095 --> 00:01:22.781
"Poor Sid," Sara said.

20
00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:25.630
Sara tried to help Sid.

21
00:01:25.631 --> 00:01:28.184
But there were lots of thorns.

22
00:01:28.185 --> 00:01:34.918
"Ouch, ouch, ouch!" Sid cried.

23
00:01:34.919 --> 00:01:38.408
"We'll help," Rex and Tor said.

24
00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:40.141
Rex ran.

25
00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:42.060
Tor flew.

26
00:01:42.061 --> 00:01:44.678
Rex didn't see a nut pile.

27
00:01:44.679 --> 00:01:48.105
He slipped.

28
00:01:48.106 --> 00:01:53.877
Bam! He hit the ground.

29
00:01:53.878 --> 00:01:59.047
"Ugh!" Suddenly Tor shouted.

30
00:01:59.048 --> 00:02:04.574
She was stuck in vines!

